to copy.\n    1. Read the 3D engine's manual: the comment at the top of the script marked \"inlined from engine/my-3d2dge-3d.js\".\n       Then the API card in <script type=\"text/markdown\" id=\"my3d2dge-api\"> below, for what the 2D engine still does in\n       a 3D game: the game and its scenes, input, the rigs and their moves, the HUD (font, ui, menus), sound.\n    2. The engines are the scripts marked \"inlined from engine/...\". They are yours to change: fix, extend or rewrite\n       any of them as you see fit (their sources, readable, are in the repository's engine/).\n       It leaves out what its game never calls (the kit diet): 1b MORE EASINGS; 2b SPRITE FRAMES, TURNS AND SWAPS;\n       9b SPANS; 10d TWEENS AND SCRIPTS; 10e PATHS; 10f TRANSITIONS; 10g WEATHER; 10h INPUT SEQUENCES; 10k SAVE\n       SLOTS; 13 TILE MAP; 14 FLOW FIELD; 16 PLATFORM MAP; 16b PLATFORMER; 16c TRAVERSAL; 17 BODY; 17b ACTIONS; 17c\n       MOVER; 17d PERCEPTION; 18 BULLETS; 19 SPATIAL HASH; 21g SOLID SHAPES; 22 GPU LIGHTING (WebGPU). Calling one\n       of them warns, naming its section (a class throws). dist/my-3d2dge-3d.html has both engines whole.\n       Its 3D engine leaves out what its game never calls (the 3D diet): 8b VEHICLES AND FLYERS.\n       Calling one wa\ntotal 15148\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 micha micha   4096 Nov  4 21:19 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 4 micha micha   4096 Nov  4 21:19 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 597067 Nov  4 21:19 my-3d2dge-3d-action.html\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 625673 Nov  4 21:19 my-3d2dge-3d-crawler.html\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 614260 Nov  4 21:19 my-3d2dge-3d-flight.html\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 639344 Nov  4 21:19 my-3d2dge-3d-horror.html\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 583547 Nov  4 21:19 my-3d2dge-3d-platformer.html\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 615080 Nov  4 21:19 my-3d2dge-3d-racing.html\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 764169 Nov  4 21:19 my-3d2dge-3d-shooter.html\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 535931 Nov  4 21:19 my-3d2dge-adventure.html\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 500164 Nov  4 21: