{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HT1VtFW1KaBirjjoSNi5zR","type":"tool_result","content":"--- task names?\n--- title leak?\n1:# PLAN: an original open-world mercenary game inspired by Far Cry 2\n705:2. Write `exit-interview.json` beside the deliverable, in exactly TASK.md's shape; validate with `python3 -m json.to\n--- headers\n13:## 1. The game\n46:## 2. Foundation\n48:### 2.1 Get the pieces\n74:### 2.2 Build into one file (VERIFIED)\n82:### 2.3 The kit, section by section\n109:### 2.4 Engine facts that will otherwise cost you hours\n124:## 3. The world\n130:### Sites (metres east, metres south)\n165:### Terrain (rewrite `baseH` and `color`)\n189:### Time, wind, weather\n197:## 4. The player and the hands\n199:### Controls (prompts always come from `game.input.label(action)`)\n221:### Moving\n225:### Holding things (pillar 3)\n237:### Health\n245:### The rasp (salt lung)\n257:## 5. Weapons and wear\n289:## 6. Fire\n318:## 7. Vehicles\n350:## 8. People\n352:### Factions\n363:### Soldier AI (extend `raiderStep`; keep its sight, hearing, bursts, strafing, hunt)\n372:### Guard posts and papers\n379:### Buddies\n413:## 9. Story and writing\n415:### Tone (TASK.md: a writing style like the source's)\n427:### Cast\n438:### The radio (vehicle radio, random order; write 20 more)\n446:### Barks (gibberish with subtitle; write 8 per faction)\n453:### Contracts (table `CONTRACTS`; an order the player mostly can't break)\n489:### The Soundings (eight survey stakes across the basin, each a tin box on a tripod)\n502:### The Sill and the endings\n518:## 10. Money, safe houses, saves\n527:## 11. Screens and 10-foot UX\n574:## 12. Sound (all generated; no audio files)\n596:## 13. Multiplayer: \"Salvage Rights\"\n650:## 14. Testing\n681:## 15. Build order\n702:### Finish\n712:## 16. TASK.md coverage\n742:## Appendix A: verified recipes\n746:### A1. Build script and page\n779:### A2. A thing held in the hand: map, logbook, shop card, locator fac