ask, day/night, the held map and flood water ran without errors on WebGL 2 and WebGPU. I also ran a jeep on the terrain, gamepad labels, music at 10% and the touch-only notice.\n\n**Limits of that testing:**\n- It ran on the kit plus prototypes, not on the finished game, so builders must re-run the hub check as their boot grows.\n- Nothing ran on a real GPU, controller or phone; those were software rendering and stand-ins, as `TASK.md` expects.\n- Numbers not marked VERIFIED, such as weapon stats, are starting points to tune with the plan's dev-mode sliders.\n\n**Exit interview:** the main complaints are that \"multiplayer… for the game on its own\" is ambiguous, and that the handoff package leaves out the 3D engine a first-person game needs. I also noted that the 20 s `ready()` wait appears only in the harness source, not the protocol README.\n\nSources:\n- [Far Cry 2 (Wikipedia)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Far_Cry_2)\n- [Far Cry 2 (Giant Bomb)](https://giantbomb.com/wiki/Games/Far_Cry_2)\n- [Mechanics 7: Heart of Darkness (GameDev.net)](https://gamedev.net/blogs/entry/1844402-mechanics-7-heart-of-darkness-far-cry-2)\n- [Far Cry factions (Far Cry Wiki)](https://farcry.fandom.com/wiki/Far_Cry_factions)","ttft_ms":1710,"type":"result","duration_ms":3402604,"uuid":"de98327b-002e-45f3-9d00-e8dfb5167f7e","ttft_stream_ms":1158,"time_to_request_ms":93,"first_content_frame_ms":1158,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":120,"outputTokens":241702,"cacheReadInputTokens":19395079,"cacheCreationInputTokens":595026,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":13.473743799999998,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":134371,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":595026,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":29227,"outputTokens":2293,"cacheReadInputTokens":872,"cacheCreationInputTokens":